致していないので修正してください: nextConfig の images.remotePatterns から hostname\n\"img.clerk.com\" を探す現在のチェック（変数 clerk）に対して、テスト名を「clerk\nはすべてのパスを許可」などに変更するか、より厳密に検証するなら clerk?.pathname が定義されているだけでなく実際の値が \"/**\"\nであることをアサートする（つまり更新対象はテスト名または expect(clerk?.pathname) の検証を pathname が \"/**\"\nであることに変更する）。\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits b33297c to f3ecba8\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-09T14:23:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:34:22Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905763843","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905763843"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905763843"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905763843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":50,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":56,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":56,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824699","pull_request_review_id":3915851251,"id":2905824699,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDONvrgrc6tM127","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@\n+import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\n+\n+describe(\"middleware ルーティング保護ロジック\", () => {\n+\tconst publicRoutes = [\"/\", \"/products\", \"/products/123\", \"/about\"];\n+\tconst protectedRoutes = [\"/cart\", \"/checkout\", \"/orders\", \"/favorites\"];\n+\tconst adminRoutes = [\"/admin\", \"/admin/products\", \"/admin/sales\"];\n+\n+\tit(\"公開ルートが正しく定義されている\", () => {\n+\t\tconst publicPatterns = [/^\\/$/, /^\\/products/, /^\\/about$/];\n+\t\tfor (const route of publicRoutes) {\n+\t\t\tconst isPublic = publicPatterns.some((p) => p.test(route));\n+\t\t\texpect(isPublic, `${route} は公開ルートであるべき`).toBe(true);\n+\t\t}\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"保護ルートが公開ルートに含まれない\", () => {\n+\t\tconst publicPatterns = [/^\\/$/, /^\\/products/, /^\\/about$/];\n+\t\tfor (const route of protectedRoutes) {\n+\t\t\tconst isPublic = publicPatterns.some((p) => p.test(route));\n+\t\t\texpect(isPublic, `${route} は公開ルートであるべきではない`).toBe(false);\n+\t\t}\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"管理者ルートの判定パターンが正しい\", () => {\n+\t\tconst adminPattern = /^\\/admin/;\n+\t\tfor (const route of adminRoutes) {\n+\t\t\texpect(adminPattern.test(route), `${route} は管理者ルート`).toBe(true);\n+\t\t}\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"ADMIN_USER_ID による管理者判定ロジック\", () => {\n+\t\tconst adminUserId = \"admin_123\";\n+\t\tconst testCases = [\n+\t\t\t{ userId: \"admin_123\", expected: true },\n+\t\t\t{ userId: \"user_456\", expected: false },\n+\t\t\t{ userId: null, expected: false },\n+\t\t];\n+\n+\t\tfor (const { userId, expected } of testCases) {\n+\t\t\tconst isAdmin = userId === adminUserId;\n+\t\t\texpect(isAdmin).toBe(expected);\n+\t\t}\n+\t});","path":"__tests__/middleware/middleware.test.ts","commit_id":"f27220ad6e86838597f6c40637e4d585ffc8afe6","original_commit_id":"ab05830db71dcd2ace5777e18e8cd4fac124fb8d","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**本番の `middleware.ts` を検証していません。**\n\nここで見ているのはローカル配列とローカル正規表現の整合性だけで、`middleware.ts` の公開ルート設定や管理者判定が壊れていてもこの test は pass します。`middleware.ts` の設定/関数を直接 import するか、`NextRequest` をモックして実際の分岐を検証してください。\n\nBased on learnings: Define public routes as `/`, `/products(.*)`, and `/about` in the middleware configuration.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@__tests__/middleware/middleware.test.ts` around lines 4 - 43, The tests\ncurrently only validate local arrays/regexes; import and assert the real\nmiddleware configuration and logic instead—import the public-route patterns\n(e.g., PUBLIC_ROUTE_PATTERNS or whatever exported constant in middleware.ts) and\nthe admin-check (e.g., ADMIN_USER_ID or exported isAdmin function) from\nmiddleware.ts and replace the local publicPatterns/adminPattern checks with\nassertions against those exports, or alternatively create mocked NextRequest\nobjects and call the exported middleware entry (e.g., middleware or\nhandleRequest) to exercise actual branching for public/protected/admin routes;\nensure test cases include \"/\" \"/products\" \"/products/123\" \"/about\" and\nadmin/non-admin user ids to validate real behavior.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits 3078e73 to 1d5d321","created_at":"2026-03-09T14:33:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:39:36Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824699","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824699"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824699"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":10,"original_start_line":4,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":69,"original_line":43,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":43,"position":69,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824704","pull_request_review_id":3915851251,"id":2905824704,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDONvrgrc6tM13A","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@\n+import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\n+import { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\n+import { resolve } from \"path\";\n+\n+describe(\"auth() 非同期化チェック\", () => {\n+\tconst filesToCheck = [\n+\t\t\"middleware.ts\",\n+\t\t\"components/navbar/LinksDropdown.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"components/products/FavoriteToggleButton.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"app/cart/page.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"app/products/[id]/page.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"utils/actions.ts\",\n+\t];\n+\n+\tit.each(filesToCheck)(\n+\t\t\"%s で auth() が await されていること\",\n+\t\t(filePath) => {\n+\t\t\tconst content = readFileSync(resolve(__dirname, \"../..\", filePath), \"utf-8\");\n+\t\t\t// auth() を呼んでいる行を抽出（import文とコメント行を除外）\n+\t\t\tconst lines = content.split(\"\\n\");\n+\t\t\tconst authCallLines = lines.filter(\n+\t\t\t\t(line) =>\n+\t\t\t\t\tline.includes(\"auth()\") &&\n+\t\t\t\t\t!line.trim().startsWith(\"import\") &&\n+\t\t\t\t\t!line.trim().startsWith(\"//\") &&\n+\t\t\t\t\t!line.trim().startsWith(\"*\")\n+\t\t\t);\n+\n+\t\t\tfor (const line of authCallLines) {\n+\t\t\t\texpect(\n+\t\t\t\t\tline,\n+\t\t\t\t\t`${filePath}: \"${line.trim()}\" で auth() が await されていません`\n+\t\t\t\t).toContain(\"await\");","path":"__tests__/migration/async-auth.test.ts","commit_id":"f27220ad6e86838597f6c40637e4d585ffc8afe6","original_commit_id":"ab05830db71dcd2ace5777e18e8cd4fac124fb8d","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**`await` の有無を文字列で見るだけだと誤判定します。**\n\n今の実装は「同じ行に `await` があるか」しか見ていないので、`const authResult = auth();` → 次行で `await authResult` のような正しい実装でも fail します。必要なのは書式ではなく「`auth()` の結果を await してから使っていること」なので、少なくとも式単位、できれば AST ベースで検証したほうが安全です。\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits b33297c to 75d3760\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-09T14:33:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T05:51:58Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824704","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824704"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824704"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":21,"original_start_line":21,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":33,"original_line":33,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":33,"position":33,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824707","pull_request_review_id":3915851251,"id":2905824707,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDONvrgrc6tM13D","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\n+\n+describe(\"params/searchParams Promise 化の型安全性\", () => {\n+\tit(\"params.id を await で取得できる\", async () => {\n+\t\tconst params = Promise.resolve({ id: \"test-id\" });\n+\t\tconst { id } = await params;\n+\t\texpect(id).toBe(\"test-id\");\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"searchParams を await で取得できる\", async () => {\n+\t\tconst searchParams = Promise.resolve({\n+\t\t\tlayout: \"grid\",\n+\t\t\tsearch: \"test\",\n+\t\t});\n+\t\tconst { layout, search } = await searchParams;\n+\t\texpect(layout).toBe(\"grid\");\n+\t\texpect(search).toBe(\"test\");\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"searchParams のデフォルト値が正しく適用される\", async () => {\n+\t\tconst searchParams = Promise.resolve({} as { layout?: string; search?: string });\n+\t\tconst { layout, search } = await searchParams;\n+\t\tconst resolvedLayout = layout || \"grid\";\n+\t\tconst resolvedSearch = search || \"\";\n+\t\texpect(resolvedLayout).toBe(\"grid\");\n+\t\texpect(resolvedSearch).toBe(\"\");\n+\t});","path":"__tests__/migration/async-params.test.ts","commit_id":"f27220ad6e86838597f6c40637e4d585ffc8afe6","original_commit_id":"ab05830db71dcd2ace5777e18e8cd4fac124fb8d","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**移行テストになっていません。**\n\nこの suite は `Promise.resolve()` を `await` しているだけで、実際の `page.tsx` / `layout.tsx` の `params`・`searchParams` シグネチャや参照方法を一切検証していません。アプリ側が同期アクセスのままでも常に通るので、対象 route component かその props 型を直接 import して検証しないと移行漏れを検出できません。\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@__tests__/migration/async-params.test.ts` around lines 3 - 27, The test\ncurrently just awaits Promise.resolve and doesn't verify the real route\ncomponent signatures; update the suite to import the actual route exports (e.g.,\nthe Page or Layout component and/or their exported props types) and assert\nagainst those types/props rather than a synthetic Promise. Concretely, replace\nthe Promise.resolve usages with references to the imported component's\nparams/searchParams type (or use TypeScript helpers like\nAwaited<Parameters<typeof Page>[0]> or the exported Props type) and add\nassertions that the component's params/searchParams are awaitable/optional as\nexpected so the test fails if page.tsx / layout.tsx still use synchronous\nsignatures.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits b33297c to c7fc0b2\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-09T14:33:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T01:25:33Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824707","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824707"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824707"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":9,"original_start_line":3,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":45,"original_line":27,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":27,"position":45,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824710","pull_request_review_id":3915851251,"id":2905824710,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDONvrgrc6tM13G","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@\n+import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\n+import { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\n+import { resolve } from \"path\";\n+\n+describe(\"Server Action の prevState 型安全性\", () => {\n+\tit(\"actionFunction 型に any が含まれていないこと\", () => {\n+\t\tconst content = readFileSync(\n+\t\t\tresolve(__dirname, \"../../utils/types.ts\"),\n+\t\t\t\"utf-8\"\n+\t\t);\n+\t\t// actionFunction 定義部分を抽出\n+\t\tconst actionFnMatch = content.match(\n+\t\t\t/export type actionFunction[\\s\\S]*?;/\n+\t\t);\n+\t\texpect(actionFnMatch).not.toBeNull();\n+\t\tconst actionFnDef = actionFnMatch![0];\n+\t\texpect(\n+\t\t\tactionFnDef,\n+\t\t\t\"actionFunction 型に any が使われています\"\n+\t\t).not.toContain(\"any\");\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"utils/actions.ts の prevState に any が使われていないこと\", () => {\n+\t\tconst content = readFileSync(\n+\t\t\tresolve(__dirname, \"../../utils/actions.ts\"),\n+\t\t\t\"utf-8\"\n+\t\t);\n+\t\tconst lines = content.split(\"\\n\");\n+\t\tconst prevStateLines = lines.filter((line) =>\n+\t\t\tline.includes(\"prevState\")\n+\t\t);\n+\n+\t\tfor (const line of prevStateLines) {\n+\t\t\texpect(\n+\t\t\t\tline,\n+\t\t\t\t`actions.ts: \"${line.trim()}\" で prevState: any が使われています`\n+\t\t\t).not.toContain(\"prevState: any\");\n+\t\t}\n+\t});\n+\n+\tit(\"FormContainer の initialState と prevState の型が一致する\", () => {\n+\t\tconst initialState = { message: \"\" };\n+\t\ttype InitialStateType = typeof initialState;\n+\t\tconst prevState: InitialStateType = { message: \"previous\" };\n+\t\texpect(prevState.message).toBe(\"previous\");\n+\t});","path":"__tests__/utils/actions-type-safety.test.ts","commit_id":"f27220ad6e86838597f6c40637e4d585ffc8afe6","original_commit_id":"ab05830db71dcd2ace5777e18e8cd4fac124fb8d","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**型安全性の検証が実体に結び付いていません。**\n\nソース文字列検索とローカル変数の代入しかしていないので、`utils/types.ts` の `actionFunction` や `FormContainer` 側の state 契約が壊れてもこの file は通ります。型だけを import して `expectTypeOf` などで実際の exported type を直接検証しないと、型安全性テストとしては機能しません。\n\nBased on learnings: Define all shared types in `utils/types.ts`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@__tests__/utils/actions-type-safety.test.ts` around lines 6 - 46, Replace the\nbrittle string searches with real type assertions: import the exported\nactionFunction type and the Form state type(s) from \"../../utils/types\" (use\nimport type { actionFunction, /* FormStateName */ } from \"../../utils/types\"),\nthen use a compile-time type assertion library like expectTypeOf to assert\nshapes (e.g. expectTypeOf<actionFunction>().not.toEqualTypeOf<any>() or\nexpectTypeOf<typeof initialState>().toEqualTypeOf<FormStateName>() and\nexpectTypeOf<PrevStateType>().toEqualTypeOf<FormStateName>()), so the test fails\nwhen the actual exported types change; reference the exported symbols\nactionFunction and the Form state type name from utils/types.ts in the\nassertions.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits b33297c to 1105322\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-09T14:33:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T02:59:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824710","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824710"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r2905824710"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":7,"original_start_line":6,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":39,"original_line":46,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":46,"position":39,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/2905824714","pull_request_review_id":3915851251,"id":2905824714,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDONvrgrc6tM13K","diff_hunk":"@@ -6,10 +6,12 @@\n \t\t\"dev\": \"next dev\",\n \t\t\"build\": \"npx prisma generate && next build\",\n \t\t\"start\": \"next start\",\n-\t\t\"lint\": \"next lint\"\n+\t\t\"lint\": \"next lint\",","path":"package.json","commit_id":"1d5d3212a7ecfa484c5d18ed48e08ded4cda3ece","original_commit_id":"ab05830db71dcd2ace5777e18e8cd4fac124fb8d","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🔴 Critical_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`Next.js 16 upgrade guide next lint command removed`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nIn **Next.js 16**, **`next lint` was removed** and **`next build` no longer runs linting**—you must run **ESLint (or Biome) directly**. [1]\n\n## Recommended migration (codemod)\nRun the official codemod to convert `next lint` → ESLint CLI, update scripts, and generate an ESLint **flat config**:\n\n```bash\npnpm dlx `@next/codemod`@canary next-lint-to-eslint-cli .\n# (or: npx `@next/codemod`@canary next-lint-to-eslint-cli .)\n```\n\nThis codemod:\n- updates `package.json` scripts (e.g. `\"lint\": \"eslint .\"`),\n- creates `eslint.config.mjs` with Next.js recommended config,\n- adds needed ESLint deps, and preserves existing config when found. [2]\n\n## Manual migration (minimal)\n1. Replace the script:\n   - from: `\"lint\": \"next lint\"`\n   - to: `\"lint\": \"eslint .\"` (or Biome)\n2. Ensure you have an ESLint config (prefer **flat config**; Next.js 16’s plugin defaults toward flat config / ESLint v10 direction). [1]\n\n**Sources:** Next.js v16 upgrade guide [1], Next.js codemods docs (next-lint-to-eslint-cli) [2].\n\n---\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`Next.js 16 linting configuration changes`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nKey linting-related changes in **Next.js 16**:\n\n- **`next lint` was removed.** You now run **ESLint directly** (or use **Biome**) instead of `next lint`. Also, the `eslint` option in `next.config.js` was removed. [1][2]\n- **`next build` no longer runs linting.** Linting is now decoupled from the build step. [2]\n- **Move to ESLint “Flat Config” (`eslint.config.*`).** Next.js 16 guidance centers on `eslint.config.mjs` (Flat Config), and `@next/eslint-plugin-next` defaults to Flat Config to align with newer ESLint direction. [3][1]\n- **Codemod-supported migration.** The **Next.js 16 upgrade codemod** can generate an `eslint.config.mjs` using Next.js recommended configs. [4]\n\nMinimal example (Flat Config) using Next’s preset (as documented by Next.js): [1]\n\n```js\n// eslint.config.mjs\nimport nextConfig from 'eslint-config-next/core-web-vitals'\n\nexport default [\n  ...nextConfig,\n]\n```\n\n**Sources:**  \n[1] Next.js ESLint configuration docs (App Router) ([nextjs.org](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/config/eslint?utm_source=openai))  \n[2] Next.js 16 announcement ([nextjs.org](https://nextjs.org/blog/next-16?utm_source=openai))  \n[3] Next.js 16 upgrade guide ([nextjs.org](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16?utm_source=openai))  \n[4] Next.js codemods (16.0) ([nextjs.org](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/codemods?utm_source=openai))\n\nCitations:\n\n- 1: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/config/eslint?utm_source=openai\n- 2: https://nextjs.org/blog/next-16?utm_source=openai\n- 3: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16?utm_source=openai\n- 4: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/codemods?utm_source=openai\n\n---\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`Next.js 16 \"next lint\" deprecated removed`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nIn **Next.js 16**, the **`next lint` command was removed** (it was **deprecated in Next.js 15.5**). Next.js 16 also **removes the `eslint` config option** from `next.config.*`. ([nextjs.org](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16?utm_source=openai))\n\n**What to do instead**\n- Run ESLint (or another linter like Biome) **directly** via your package scripts, e.g. `eslint .` (and keep using `eslint-config-next` / `eslint-plugin-next` if you want Next.js rules). ([nextjs.org](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16?utm_source=openai))\n\nCitations:\n\n- 1: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16?utm_source=openai\n- 2: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16?utm_source=openai\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**`next lint` は Next.js 16 で削除されました。**\n\nNext.js 16 では `next lint` コマンドが削除されたため、このスクリプトは `npm run lint` を実行すると即座に失敗します。ESLint を直接実行するよう更新が必要です。\n\n公式の codemod を使った自動移行を推奨します。以下を実行すると、`package.json` スクリプトの更新と `eslint.config.mjs` の生成が自動で行われます：\n\n```bash\nnpx `@next/codemod`@canary next-lint-to-eslint-cli .\n```\n\nまたは手動で修正する場合：\n\n<details>\n<summary>修正案</summary>\n\n```diff\n-\t\t\"lint\": \"next lint\",\n+\t\t\"lint\": \"eslint .\",\n```\n</details>\n\n合わせて ESLint の Flat Config (`eslint.config.mjs`) への移行も検討してください。詳細は [Next.js 16 アップグレードガイド](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/upgrading/version-16) を参照してください。\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@package.json` at line 9, Update the package.json \"lint\" script because \"next\nlint\" was removed in Next.js 16; either run the recommended codemod (npx\n`@next/codemod`@canary next-lint-to-eslint-cli .) to auto-migrate or manually\nreplace the \"lint\" script value from \"next lint\" to an ESLint CLI invocation\nsuch as \"eslint . --ext .js,.jsx,.ts,.tsx\" (and ensure eslint.config.mjs /\nESLint Flat Config is present).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits 3078e73 to a2e66ac","created_at":"2026-03-09T14:33:37Z","u