pes.ts utils/actions.ts components/form/FormContainer.tsx --items all --type function --view compact 2>/dev/null || true\n\nprintf '\\n--- actionFunction definitions/usages ---\\n'\nrg -n -C 3 '\\bactionFunction\\b' utils components app --glob '*.{ts,tsx}' || true\n\nprintf '\\n--- reported action definitions ---\\n'\nrg -n -A 14 -B 2 'export\\s+const\\s+(deleteProductAction|deleteReviewAction|toggleFavoriteAction)\\b' utils/actions.ts || true\n\nprintf '\\n--- FormContainer call sites and bindings ---\\n'\nrg -n -C 5 '<FormContainer\\b|\\.bind\\(' components app --glob '*.{ts,tsx}' || true\n\nprintf '\\n--- FormContainer implementation ---\\n'\nsed -n '1,180p' components/form/FormContainer.tsx\n\nprintf '\\n--- utils/types.ts ---\\n'\nsed -n '1,80p' utils/types.ts\n```\n\nLength of output: 13107\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n`@myoshi2891`、確認しました。この指摘は不要です。\n\n`.bind()` は識別子オブジェクトを各アクションの第1引数へ事前に設定します。その結果、`deleteProductAction`、`deleteReviewAction`、`toggleFavoriteAction` の bound action は追加の必須引数を持ちません。\n\nTypeScript では、必須引数が少ない関数を `actionFunction` として渡せます。`FormContainer` と `useActionState` の使用はこの実装で問題ありません。\n\nこのレビュー指摘を取り下げます。\n\n✅ Review thread resolved.\n\n_You are interacting with an AI system._\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-09-16T02:14:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T02:15:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r4021901369","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/4021901369"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r4021901369"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/4021901369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_