toggleFavoriteAction'\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- FormContainer structure ---'\nast-grep outline components/form/FormContainer.tsx --items all\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- actionFunction declarations and FormContainer call sites ---'\nrg -n -C 5 '\\b(actionFunction|FormContainer)\\b' --glob='*.ts' --glob='*.tsx'\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- target action definitions and binding call sites ---'\nrg -n -C 7 '\\b(deleteProductAction|deleteReviewAction|toggleFavoriteAction)\\b|\\.bind\\(null,' --glob='*.ts' --glob='*.tsx'\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- relevant source excerpts ---'\nfor f in utils/types.ts utils/actions.ts; do\n  if [ -f \"$f\" ]; then\n    printf '\\n### %s ###\\n' \"$f\"\n    rg -n -C 4 '\\b(actionFunction|deleteProductAction|deleteReviewAction|toggleFavoriteAction)\\b' \"$f\" || true\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\nLength of output: 42253\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n`@myoshi2891`、ご指摘のとおりです。この指摘は不要でした。\n\n`deleteProductAction`、`deleteReviewAction`、`toggleFavoriteAction` は、`.bind(null, ...)` 後の関数を `FormContainer` に渡しています。バインド後の関数は識別子データを保持し、`useActionState` が渡す追加引数を使用しません。追加引数は JavaScript で無視されるため、実行時の状態管理は壊れません。\n\n元の指摘は、未バインドの関数シグネチャを比較していました。指摘を取り下げます。\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>✏️ Learnings added</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: myoshi2891\nRepo: myoshi2891/Next-Store PR: 28\nFile: components/form/FormContainer.tsx:15-15\nTimestamp: 2026-09-16T02:14:54.664Z\nLearning: In the Next-Store React form flow, `deleteProductAction`, `deleteReviewAction`, and `toggleFavoriteAction` receive their identifier state through `.bind(null, ...)` before being passed to `components/form/FormContainer.tsx`. The resulting bound functions do not consume the `useActionState` state and `FormData` arguments, and this is valid because unused JavaScript arguments are ignored.\n```\n\n> Note: Learnings are effective only in the context of similar code segments. To apply general coding guidelines, please configure [review instructions](https://docs.coderabbit.ai/guides/review-instructions). You can manage existing learnings in the [app](https://app.coderabbit.ai/learnings).\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n✅ Review thread resolved.\n\n_You are interacting with an AI system._\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-09-16T02:14:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T02:15:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r4021901371","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/4021901371"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28#discussion_r4021901371"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/4021901371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":15,"original_line":15,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2906255015,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":10,"position":10,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/comments/4022056131","pull_request_review_id":5217992416,"id":4022056131,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDONvrgrc7vu7TD","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@\n+import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\n+import { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\n+import { resolve } from \"path\";\n+\n+describe(\"auth() 非同期化チェック\", () => {\n+\tconst filesToCheck = [\n+\t\t\"middleware.ts\",\n+\t\t\"components/navbar/LinksDropdown.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"components/products/FavoriteToggleButton.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"app/cart/page.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"app/products/[id]/page.tsx\",\n+\t\t\"utils/actions.ts\",\n+\t];\n+\n+\tit.each(filesToCheck)(\n+\t\t\"%s で auth() が await されていること\",\n+\t\t(filePath) => {\n+\t\t\tconst content = readFileSync(resolve(__dirname, \"../..\", filePath), \"utf-8\");\n+\t\t\t// auth() を呼んでいる行を抽